<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Batch D1 violations 2.0 fixture, exercising the 2.0-only DEFINE-XML-0160-B
     (Define-XML 2.0 Origin Type term set): IT.B carries the 2.1-only term
     "Collected" (invalid in 2.0, fires once); IT.A carries the 2.0 term "CRF"
     (valid, decoy). Everything else is compliant for the both-version rules
     (no ItemGroupDefs, so the ItemRef-scoped rules have an empty scope; 2.0 has
     no ODM def:Context, so the Context-guarded rules never pass their guard). -->
